  "description": "“Do it well.”\n\nEven while doing something indecent, he liked the way her innocent face reacted.\n\nYoon Sojeong, deputy manager of the External Relations Team in the Business Support Department, was good at everything.\n\n“Let’s put an end to this here.”\n\nA year later, she once again provoked him smartly. The reason, she said, was marriage.\n\n“You already knew what kind of man I was. Don’t act like it’s a surprise.”\n\nPretending he’s fine, Muhyeok takes Sojeong again,\nbut an unquenchable thirst fills his entire body.\n\n“People’s hearts change. If you ever change your mind, just tell me. Even after you’re married—it doesn’t matter.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/landing/episode/11266), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5265000439), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000072457), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/eumranhan_sai), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250642)",
